1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,782
welcome to the AI Automation Path,

2
00:00:03,032 --> 00:00:08,849
This is where you move beyond simply using AI tools,
and start understanding how real AI-powered systems

3
00:00:08,849 --> 00:00:09,534
are built

4
00:00:11,334 --> 00:00:16,024
Because today, the biggest opportunity is not just
asking a chatbot for answers

5
00:00:17,224 --> 00:00:23,435
The real opportunity is learning how to connect AI
automations, voice agents, proposals, dashboards,

6
00:00:23,435 --> 00:00:27,255
and business workflows into systems  that can actually
work for you

7
00:00:28,455 --> 00:00:32,494
In this path, you are going to learn how AI becomes
more than a tool

8
00:00:33,495 --> 00:00:36,328
and how AI becomes an operating system for business

9
00:00:37,528 --> 00:00:40,151
At the beginning, you will start with the foundation.

10
00:00:40,152 --> 00:00:45,005
Before building anything, you need to understand what
is happening behind the scenes.

11
00:00:45,005 --> 00:00:47,466
You will learn how AI actually works,

12
00:00:47,966 --> 00:00:49,266
why prompting matters,

13
00:00:50,266 --> 00:00:53,238
how automation platforms connect different tools
together,

14
00:00:54,238 --> 00:00:57,350
and what makes an AI agent different from a normal
workflow.

15
00:00:58,350 --> 00:01:03,412
This part is important, because once you understand
the logic, the tools stop feeling random.

16
00:01:03,412 --> 00:01:05,119
You start seeing the full picture.

17
00:01:05,119 --> 00:01:07,057
A form becomes the entry point.

18
00:01:07,057 --> 00:01:08,753
A database becomes the memory.

19
00:01:08,753 --> 00:01:10,982
An automation platform becomes the engine.

20
00:01:10,982 --> 00:01:14,000
And AI becomes the intelligence inside the system

21
00:01:15,201 --> 00:01:18,846
In the Foundation Level, you will build the mindset
first.

22
00:01:18,846 --> 00:01:22,678
You will understand the difference between AI tools
and AI systems

23
00:01:23,677 --> 00:01:23,828
.

24
00:01:23,828 --> 00:01:30,608
You will learn prompting fundamentals, structured
prompting, automation logic, triggers, inputs, outputs,

25
00:01:30,608 --> 00:01:34,114
workflow sequences, and the idea of AI agents.

26
00:01:34,114 --> 00:01:41,498
You will also get introduced to the main tools used
inside the path, including ChatGPT, OpenAI, Make.com,

27
00:01:41,498 --> 00:01:45,782
Airtable, Vapi, PandaDoc, Slack, Perplexity, and Tally.

28
00:01:45,782 --> 00:01:48,882
By the end of this level, you will not just know what
these tools are.

29
00:01:48,882 --> 00:01:52,842
You will understand how they fit together inside a
real automation system.

30
00:01:54,042 --> 00:01:56,700
After that, you enter the Mastery Level.

31
00:01:56,700 --> 00:02:01,902
Here, you move from a single automation pipeline into
a larger AI business system.

32
00:02:01,902 --> 00:02:06,453
You will explore the   AI Architecture, where different
AI agents work together.

33
00:02:06,453 --> 00:02:12,200
You will build a research agent, a sales agent, a
proposal agent, a marketing agent, an intelligence

34
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:14,917
agent, and an operations dashboard.

35
00:02:14,917 --> 00:02:22,208
This is where you start understanding how AI can support
not just one task, but an entire business process.

36
00:02:22,208 --> 00:02:23,972
Each agent has a role.

37
00:02:23,972 --> 00:02:26,038
Each part of the system adds value.

38
00:02:26,038 --> 00:02:29,893
And together, they begin to act like a coordinated
digital workforce.

39
00:02:31,093 --> 00:02:36,166
By the end of this path, you will have gone from AI
curiosity to real system building.

40
00:02:36,166 --> 00:02:42,297
You will understand how to design AI workflows, connect
tools together, automate business processes, build

41
00:02:42,297 --> 00:02:47,125
AI-powered sales infrastructure, and think in systems
instead of separate tasks.

42
00:02:47,126 --> 00:02:50,180
And that is the real transformation of this path.

43
00:02:50,180 --> 00:02:52,594
You are not here just to learn AI.

44
00:02:52,594 --> 00:02:54,754
You are here to learn how to build with it.

45
00:02:54,754 --> 00:02:58,527
So as you begin the AI Automation Path, remember this:

46
00:02:58,527 --> 00:03:04,134
Every lesson is taking you closer to becoming someone
who can look at a business process and think, "How

47
00:03:04,134 --> 00:03:06,584
can I turn this into a smart system?"

48
00:03:06,584 --> 00:03:09,080
That is the skill you are building here.

49
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:12,656
And this is where your journey as an AI system builder
begins.

